0..67 Comment "// Unbiased composition of a chain of paths at a certified stratum."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..145 Comment "// A chain of paths has one composite up to its bracketings, so the former"
146..196 Comment "// names that composite and chooses no bracketing."
197..199 Comment "//"
200..283 Comment "// `compose[n, k](chain(m), (c₁, …, cₘ))` composes `m` cells that meet end to"
284..362 Comment "// end. The chain sub-site certifies the stratum at degree `n` over bound `k`,"
363..442 Comment "// and the chain is a shape of it. The node carries the left-nested `then` fold"
443..517 Comment "// of its cells. Evaluation runs the fold, and the kernel replays it as it"
518..559 Comment "// replays the chain written with `then`."
560..562 Comment "//"
563..616 Comment "// - see: `then.gandr` — the composite of two paths"
617..699 Comment "// - see: `ledger/diagnostics/ComposeDoesNotFill.gandr` — cells that do not meet"
701..739 Comment "// The circle, its point and its loop."
740..746 Keyword "import"
747..748 StringLit "\""
748..767 StringLit "./circle-base.gandr"
767..768 StringLit "\""
768..769 Other ";"
